931:Stand sideways with your right leg raised in the air.
932:Pull open your collar with one hand, and clench your other hand into a fist near your hip.
933:Put one hand on your waist, and bend your left leg.
934:Place one hand against your forehead, and rest your other hand on your waist with fingers spread.
935:Stick one hand in your pocket, and point at the camera with the index finger of your other hand.
936:Rest your chin in one hand while arching your body to accentuate your curves.
